      ],
      "memoryEvidence": {
        "flash": "Manufacturer README and official storefront specify 16 MB P4 flash.",
        "psram": "Official storefront t-display-p4 explicitly specifies P4 PSRAM 32 MB.",
        "coprocessor": "README specifies C6 4 MB flash. It is not 4 MB PSRAM and is not a second running CPU in this profile.",
        "sourceIds": [
          "p4-README-md",
          "official-store-shopify-1"
        ]
      },
      "scope": "T-Display-P4 V1.0 的 P4 rev < 3 指令、UART、GPIO35 BOOT、准确 G7/G8 路由的 I2C0 / XL9535 数字寄存器及 SDMMC 可调试；540×1168 屏幕提供模型预览，MIPI-DSI 帧输出尚未实现。",
